{"name":"Nathoud","status":"ok","title":"Nathoud","pageId":59769,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Nathoud\" title=\"Category:Maps of Nathoud\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Nathoud</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fortified town</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Horses</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SW5oYWJpdGFudHNfb2ZfTmF0aG91ZD9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Nathoud (page does not exist)\">Inhabitants of  Nathoud</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6RXZlbnRzX2luX05hdGhvdWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Category:Events in Nathoud (page does not exist)\">Events in  Nathoud</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Nathoud </b> was a fortified town located in the northern region of the <a href=\"/wiki/Hordelands\" title=\"Hordelands\">Hordelands</a> bordering <a href=\"/wiki/Rashemen\" title=\"Rashemen\">Rashemen</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nathoud sat in the hill country at the feet of the southern slopes of the <a href=\"/wiki/Icerim_Mountains\" title=\"Icerim Mountains\">Icerim Mountains</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Wood was used in the construction of Nathoud since stone-working was little known in the region. The buildings of Nathoud were typically two stories tall and had large overhanging eaves with gently sloping roofs. Elaborate carvings decorated most buildings.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Myir\" title=\"Myir\">Myir</a>, a clan of <a href=\"/wiki/Nar_(ethnicity)\" title=\"Nar (ethnicity)\">Nars</a>, originally built the town when they came to settle, since they could not compete with the fierce <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvS2hhc3NhZGk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\" title=\"Khassadi (page does not exist)\">Khassadi</span> horsemen of the region.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The Myir of Nathoud were famous for their breeding of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nathoudi_stallion\" title=\"Nathoudi stallion\">Nathoudi stallion</a>. A yearly horse fair was held in Nathoud. Vendors interested in selling horses during this time needed to apply for a license. Races were held where vendors and horse-breeders could show off their prized animals.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Nathoud?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-TH.VII-p86-88-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-TH.VII-p86-88_1-5\">1.5</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Cook\" title=\"David Cook\">David Cook</a> (August 1990). “Volume II”. In <a href=\"/wiki/Steve_Winter\" title=\"Steve Winter\">Steve Winter</a> ed. <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Horde\" title=\"The Horde\">The Horde</a></i> (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), pp. 86–88. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-88038-868-4\">0-88038-868-4</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260517065034\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.059 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 776/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1752/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 718/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1980/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.914      1 -total\n 72.76%   49.414      1 Template:Location\n 20.94%   14.221      1 Template:Refs\n 11.81%    8.024      1 Template:Cite_book/The_Horde/Volume_II\n  9.82%    6.670      1 Template:Cite_book\n  7.81%    5.306      1 Template:Cite_publication\n  2.74%    1.863      1 Template:MakeUnionCatLink\n  2.36%    1.602      1 Template:FormatPageNumbers\n  1.92%    1.305      2 Template:FormatAlias\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:59769-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260517065034 and revision id 974426. Rendering was trigger